<%# A signed-in phone's account tools, below 768px only. They ride the engine
    navbar's icon slot, beside the account control.

    The theme toggle and cog are the collapsed bar's: the engine's phone row
    carries them at rest and is gone once the bar collapses (the .nav-phone-*
    rules in application.css). The toggle leads, as it does on the desktop rail.

    The name is not here: Studio.navbar_phone_name draws it inside the engine's
    account control, so it hovers, clicks and reads as the avatar does. %>
<span class="nav-phone-tools flex md:hidden">
  <%= render "components/theme_toggle_morph" %>
  <%= render "components/link_sidebar_trigger" %>
</span>
